2085bde9db2fd361bafb73e46c5f2db7e3e3ee1ac2", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}], "original_path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-05/MATHPKG-70ba4f3afa32abe9d161f245", "original_sha256": "86bb42be0d340c86f8b6913a0b957b4b49000036e3b4d8cc7b2bc3cc48cd3e28", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-fba05034bd1db9d6a69ac4c3", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/ae13211338ad4935e198e506e83fce058d436e50b48828f6c9a5a69f031be194.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "ae13211338ad4935e198e506e83fce058d436e50b48828f6c9a5a69f031be194", "user_turn_count": 4, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 370], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "52e56b6c5829fd583953018fcd3df47074cc597128e2170a66795dca0676ebae", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 907], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "85708e2625d990ac5414126f5dd624b3a95ad03a62c38c478100740acc995fba", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}, {"character_range": [0, 334], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "b2c667f8a0d99fb5e055d677701812c780fbfda49227100df7c7d0c094ca67ca", "role": "user", "sequence": 5}, {"character_range": [0, 106], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "7f90bc50350eb1e07e657b2c072eb28a14d164ea6a0d50864216d953842cf2c8", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "这道题我完全无从下手。\n\n我算了一下 α 与 β 叉乘的模长，它等于 |α|·|β|·sin⟨α, β⟩。已知 sin⟨α, β⟩ = 1/2，|β| = 2，所以 |α × β| = |α|（这我知道）。\n\n然后我就可以写成 lim (x→0) [|α + xβ| - |α × β|] / x。但接下来这个式子我不知道该怎么算：想把 α 和 β 提出去又提不出去，直接卡住了。\n\n后面不管是按导数定义做，还是看成 0/0 型用洛必达法则：\n如果用洛必达法则，分子该怎么求导？能导出来个什么东西？分母求导等于 1 我知道，但分子是个模长，对 x 求导后会出来一个 β 吗？因为 |α| 是常数求导就没了，而 α 后面带的是 xβ，导完难道就只剩 β 了？那它的模长就等于 2？这题答案直接等于 2，不可能吧？\n\n这题确实不知道该怎么下手了"}